# Operator books — misc folder routing

Operator-authored books live in **existing misc folders**. There is **no** central operator-books registry or `LIB-*` id layer.

## `predictive-history`

**`predictive-history`** (hyphenated) → multivolume corpus under **`continuity/predictive-history/`** (`BOOK-ARCHITECTURE.md`, `STATUS.md`).

**Do not** default to **`research/external/youtube-channels/predictive-history/`** (YouTube transcript bundle). For that, say **Predictive History YouTube transcript library** or the full **`youtube-channels/predictive-history`** path.

## `strategy-codex` / `strategy-notebook`

**`strategy-codex`** (preferred) → **`continuity/`** (`STATUS.md`, `chapters/`, `daily-strategy-inbox.md`, `STRATEGY-NOTEBOOK-ARCHITECTURE.md`). Legacy path: **`codex/`** redirect only.

**`strategy-notebook`** (legacy phrase) → same destination **`continuity/`** — do **not** use for new paths or docs. Full spec: [STRATEGY-NOTEBOOK-DEPRECATED.md](../../docs/archive/skill-work-legacy/work-strategy/STRATEGY-NOTEBOOK-DEPRECATED.md).

Legacy path `docs/archive/skill-work-legacy/work-strategy/strategy-notebook/` is **compat redirect only** — do not add artifacts.

**Do not** treat **`strategy-codex`** as **`STRATEGY.md`** (milestone ledger).

